  "description": "Rotating discovery IDs (RDI): HMAC-SHA-256 salt and SHA-256 id derivations, 15-minute epochs, roles 0..3, BDO1 link opening, selection check, route tokens and recovery hints (PROTOCOL 'Experimental rotating discovery IDs'). salt = HMAC-SHA256(key, domain_salt || u32 epoch || u8 role); RDI = SHA-256(domain_id || nodeId(16) || u32 epoch || u8 role || salt)[0:6]; domain_salt/domain_id are ASCII 'BluetoothVideoMesh/Discovery/Salt/1' / '.../Id/1' with a trailing NUL. BDO1 = 'BDO1' | version 1 | count (0..2) | count x entry(rdi(6) | u32 epoch | u8 role | salt(32)). Roles: 0 call offer, 1 stream offer, 2 viewer request, 3 window offer. The vector 'presence key' P is the 32 bytes 00 01 .. 1f (ByteArray(32){it}); the node ID is a1b2c3d4e5f60718293a4b5c6d7e8f90; epoch 1990656 = 0x001e6000 = unix 2026-10-10T00:00:00Z / 900."
}
